@startuml Admin_Emergency_Hotlines_Management_SSD

actor "Administrator" as Admin
participant "UI: Emergency Management" as UI
participant "Database" as DB
participant "S3 Storage" as S3

== View Emergency Hotlines ==

Admin -> UI: Access emergency hotlines page
activate UI

UI -> DB: Fetch active hotlines
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return active hotlines (sorted by position)
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Fetch archived hotlines
activate DB
DB --> UI: Return archived hotlines
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Display hotlines (Active/Archived tabs)
deactivate UI

== Add Emergency Hotline ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Add Agency"
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Display form (Name, Icon, Contact Channels)

Admin -> UI: Enter agency details, Upload icon, Add contact channels

UI -> UI: Validate input (name, icon, contact channels required)

alt Input valid
    UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
    Admin -> UI: Confirm add
    
    UI -> S3: Upload icon image
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return S3 URL
    deactivate S3
    
    UI -> DB: Save hotline record (name, icon URL, contact channels, position)
    activate DB
    DB --> UI: Hotline created
    deactivate DB
    
    UI -> DB: Log admin action
    activate DB
    deactivate DB
    
    UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
else Input invalid
    UI --> Admin: Show validation errors
end

deactivate UI

== Edit Emergency Hotline ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Edit" on hotline
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Display form with current data

Admin -> UI: Modify details and submit

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm update

alt New icon uploaded
    UI -> S3: Delete old icon
    activate S3
    deactivate S3
    
    UI -> S3: Upload new icon
    activate S3
    S3 --> UI: Return new S3 URL
    deactivate S3
end

UI -> DB: Update hotline record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Hotline updated
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Log admin action
activate DB
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Show success, refresh list
deactivate UI

== Reorder Emergency Hotlines ==

Admin -> UI: Drag and drop hotline to new position
activate UI

UI -> UI: Update local order

UI -> DB: Update positions in database
activate DB
DB --> UI: Positions updated
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Display reordered list
deactivate UI

== Archive Emergency Hotline ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Archive"
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm archive

UI -> DB: Update hotline status (archived: true)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Hotline archived
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Log admin action
activate DB
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Restore Emergency Hotline ==

Admin -> UI: Switch to Archived tab
activate UI

Admin -> UI: Click "Restore"
UI --> Admin: Show confirmation dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm restore

UI -> DB: Update hotline status (archived: false)
activate DB
DB --> UI: Hotline restored
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Log admin action
activate DB
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh lists
deactivate UI

== Delete Emergency Hotline ==

Admin -> UI: Click "Delete" on archived hotline
activate UI

UI --> Admin: Show warning dialog
Admin -> UI: Confirm delete

UI -> S3: Delete icon from S3
activate S3
deactivate S3

UI -> DB: Remove hotline record
activate DB
DB --> UI: Hotline deleted
deactivate DB

UI -> DB: Log admin action
activate DB
deactivate DB

UI --> Admin: Refresh archived list
deactivate UI

@enduml
